WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:02.920
Dr. Bethany Moore was exhausted.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:09.450
She’d been pulling an all-nighter to digitize
some old files about SCP-2317 - the door to

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:14.740
another world - and she could feel herself
nodding off, little by little, as the night

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:15.740
drew on.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.589
For Dr. Moore, it’d been a whole week of
long days, something even worse when you work

00:00:20.589 --> 00:00:26.249
a job as stressful as being a researcher for
the SCP Foundation, and the exertion was starting

00:00:26.249 --> 00:00:27.740
to catch up with her.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:32.740
At around 2:30 AM, she sighed, rolled back
her office chair, and decided to take a quick

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:35.149
break to grab a coffee and refuel.

00:00:35.149 --> 00:00:39.960
If she didn’t get some pretty hardcore caffeine
in her over the next few minutes, she was

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:43.020
absolutely going to pass out on her keyboard.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:47.010
The fact that the rooms in the facility were
kept at relatively low light at this time

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:50.579
of night to save power really wasn’t helping
her fatigue.

00:00:50.579 --> 00:00:55.670
Dr. Moore dragged herself down to the break
room, too tired and too focused on her work

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:58.760
to notice that things were eerily quiet.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:03.420
She was punching in her order for the largest
Espresso available when she noticed the quiet

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:06.300
sound of footsteps approaching her from behind.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:12.270
Slow, methodical, and unsettling, especially
at this kind of hour.

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:14.890
She turned and felt an immense relief wash
over her.

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:19.900
It was just Security Officer Chuck Walker,
one of the regular guards at this site.

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:24.280
Dr. Moore and Security Officer Walker weren’t
exactly best friends, but they’d crossed

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:29.280
paths on the job on numerous occasions, and
they’d always been polite, friendly, and

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:31.800
cordial any time they’d directly interacted.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:36.100
“Hey Chuck,” she said, while her coffee
began to pour into the less than environmentally

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.170
friendly styrofoam cup behind her.

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:39.170
“Long night.

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:41.280
Working hard or hardly working, eh?”

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.620
Security Officer Walker didn’t respond.

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:48.640
It was only now that Dr. Moore seemed to register
just how dark the break room was.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:53.460
Really, the only source of light was the soft
glow coming from the coffee machine itself.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:58.600
But light or no light, she could see that
something was wrong with Walker.

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:04.500
His eyes seemed oddly distant, like he wasn’t
even looking at her, he was looking through

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:07.530
her, off into some unknown place.

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:09.469
Dr. Moore cleared her throat.

00:02:09.469 --> 00:02:11.030
“Everything okay, Chu-“

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:14.939
Before she could even finish her sentence,
Chuck’s hands were clasped around her throat.

00:02:14.939 --> 00:02:17.280
The movement was so sudden and violent.

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:21.970
Her back was shoved up against the coffee
machine, spilling the Espresso everywhere.

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:25.120
She tried to scream, but she couldn’t get
enough air.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:29.299
Chuck squeezed; his grip was like iron around
her thin neck.

00:02:29.299 --> 00:02:34.349
She silently gasped and spluttered as he choked
her, still maintaining that glassy, almost

00:02:34.349 --> 00:02:39.650
dead look in his eye, like doing this meant
absolutely nothing to him.

00:02:39.650 --> 00:02:43.640
As things started to go dark, Dr. Moore’s
thoughts were naturally along the lines of,

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.599
“Why is he doing this to me?”

00:02:45.599 --> 00:02:48.720
And that’s exactly when she got her answer.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:53.269
There were two eyes that seemed almost to
be floating in the darkness behind Security

00:02:53.269 --> 00:02:59.269
Office Walker, staring with equal indifference
at this sudden and awful display of meaningless

00:02:59.269 --> 00:03:00.269
violence.

00:03:00.269 --> 00:03:04.780
She could only just make out the slender shape
of the creature’s mostly obsidian body,

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:07.170
with the occasional patch of white.

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:08.340
It was Her.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:09.780
It all made sense now.

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:12.480
It all made so much sense.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.690
The Daughter Of-

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:14.690
Snap.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:19.189
Dr. Moore’s neck broke, leaving her last
thought forever unfinished.

00:03:19.189 --> 00:03:23.430
Security Office Walker loosened his grip,
allowing Dr. Moore’s body to slump to the

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.430
ground.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:28.849
He turned to his Mistress for approval, but
she didn’t say a word.

00:03:28.849 --> 00:03:32.450
She just left the room, and he obediently
followed.

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:36.280
This was the very first casualty of a containment
breach that would go on to claim the lives

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:40.109
of 43 members of SCP Foundation personnel.

00:03:40.109 --> 00:03:44.140
Several male members of staff experienced
what can only be described as a descent into

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:49.819
violent insanity, turning on fellow members
of personnel and committing murder, largely

00:03:49.819 --> 00:03:51.720
through the act of strangulation.

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:57.129
A female Mobile Task Force was brought in
to deal with this rapidly-escalating situation.

00:03:57.129 --> 00:04:01.870
The brainwashed staff members were relatively
easy to neutralize, given the superior training

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:06.910
of the MTF compared to on-site staff, but
the being that did this to them would be a

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:15.190
considerably more challenging foe: SCP-029,
the Daughter Of Shadows, an extremely violent

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:17.400
and dangerous Keter-Class anomaly.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:22.360
She was still loose on the site, and that
meant nobody was safe.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:26.890
The MTF prowled the hallways in three-person
squads, while another small detachment headed

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:29.410
to the maintenance and security rooms.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:33.240
They couldn’t rely on the on-site guards
for any help on this one, considering half

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:38.020
the brainwashed murderers they’d just terminated
had formerly been site guards.

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:43.800
One of the squads finally encountered SCP-029
in a dark hallway and engaged her in violent

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:44.800
combat.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:49.400
The Daughter Of Shadows is an incredibly formidable
opponent: She’s significantly stronger than

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:54.090
a non-anomalous human being, she’s highly
resistant to most forms of damage, and her

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:58.700
reflexes are around four times faster than
some of the fastest recorded non-anomalous

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.320
human reflexes.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:04.740
In other words, seeing as she can shrug off
bullets and seems to be one of the world’s

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:10.520
most proficient stranglers, you really don’t
want to have to engage with SCP-029 in a physical

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:11.830
fight.

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:17.090
One of the three MTF operatives attempting
to subdue SCP-029 was already dead, her neck

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:21.810
practically caved in from the force of a squeeze,
when the lights finally came back on.

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:26.180
While the Foundation didn’t know a great
deal about the Daughter of Shadows, they were

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:32.410
aware of one thing: Her anomalous powers were
significantly weakened when faced with bright

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:33.410
light.

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:36.410
The operatives in the maintenance and security
rooms had turned up the lights in the hallway

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:40.600
to their maximum brightness, stunning the
Daughter Of Shadows just long enough for the

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:45.441
Mobile Task Force to converge and, through
their combined strength and resources, subdue

00:05:45.441 --> 00:05:48.050
and contain the creature again.

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:53.470
She was swiftly delivered back to her high-security
containment chamber and locked away once more.

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:57.460
The containment chamber is sealed with a triple
airlock, and powerful floodlights on the walls

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:00.810
keep the creature in a constant state of stark
illumination.

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:05.890
A truly foolish mistake by Security Officer
Walker - who’d been shot to death not even

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:10.740
an hour prior by the Mobile Task Force - had
caused this particularly deadly containment

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:11.740
breach.

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:15.820
Ignoring very specific Foundation containment
protocols out of his own sense of foolish

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:21.630
morbid curiosity, he’d strayed too close
to SCP-029’s containment chamber, and been

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:24.720
dragged into her terrible thrall.

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:29.850
Considering the vast array of potential world
or even universe-enders on the SCP Foundation’s

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:35.510
roster, SCP-029 is far from the most dangerous
anomaly out there, but she’s proven time

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:39.250
and time again to be one of the most problematic
to contain.

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:44.480
And due to her incredibly violent temperament
and dangerous anomalous abilities, every time

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:50.360
SCP-029 does breach containment, a lot of
innocent Foundation employees are bound to

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:51.360
die.

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:55.090
The Daughter of Shadows, a self-given name
that seems to be inspired by the fact her

00:06:55.090 --> 00:07:01.030
skin pigmentation is 80% True Black, has a
seemingly unquenchable blood lust.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:04.780
Though ironically, she despises the actual
shedding of blood.

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:10.710
SCP-029 has been shown to be capable of improvising
a weapon out of almost any object, truly the

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:16.060
MacGyver of Murder, but she will always kill
in a manner that causes no blood to be spilled,

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:18.420
hence her preference for strangulation.

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:23.310
She also has the ability to brainwash male
victims into committing murder on her behalf,

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:27.090
by making them believe that she is some form
of Goddess.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:31.990
Despite showing clear sentience and sound
tactical reasoning, it’s impossible to reason

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:37.440
with the Daughter Of Shadows, as she has no
compassion or better judgment to appeal to.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:43.151
Her requests for a bed, a blanket, some books,
and some clothes have all been denied, due

00:07:43.151 --> 00:07:47.710
to the pretty justifiable belief that all
these requests are just a pretense to get

00:07:47.710 --> 00:07:49.760
security lowered around her.

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:54.830
This harsh treatment actually led to an official
complaint by Dr. Ericka Bodeen.

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:55.860
It stated, “This is ridiculous!

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:57.330
The girl can't even have clothes?

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:59.580
We are not animals, let her cover herself!”

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:04.460
Dr. Sophia Light posted an official reply,
saying, “Dr. Bodeen, you are granted permission

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:07.660
to deliver clothes to SCP-029.”

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:10.900
Life sadly punished Dr. Bodeen for her compassion.

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:15.050
The Daughter Of Shadows murdered her with
the very clothes she brought in to keep it

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:19.570
warm, and the tape of her grisly death is
now used as an educational tool for anyone

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:25.220
assigned to SCP-029 - A grim reminder of the
real and present danger that the creature

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:27.980
poses to anyone in its vicinity.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:32.740
Because of the nature of the anomaly and her
abilities, the Foundation takes a very hands-off

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.279
approach to interacting with her.

00:08:35.279 --> 00:08:41.419
Guards are posted outside, and not even food
is brought into the chamber, as SCP-029 seems

00:08:41.419 --> 00:08:43.930
to be able to survive just fine without it.

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:47.579
At this point, you’re probably wondering:
What is this thing, really?

00:08:47.579 --> 00:08:50.690
And how did the SCP Foundation find it in
the first place?

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:52.970
We’ll tell you all we can about that.

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:58.360
But be warned: SCP-029 is also linked to one
of the darkest things the Foundation has ever

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:02.449
needed to do in the pursuit of keeping an
anomaly contained...

00:09:02.449 --> 00:09:07.980
It all began with what seemed like an incredibly
random assault on Agent Ramachandran, an SCP

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:11.389
Foundation Field Operative stationed in rural
India.

00:09:11.389 --> 00:09:15.999
The assailant attempted to strangle Agent
Ramachandran before being quickly subdued.

00:09:15.999 --> 00:09:20.490
Because of the strangeness of the event, the
agent began a weeks-long investigation into

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:24.209
who the man was, and why he’d committed
this attack.

00:09:24.209 --> 00:09:29.050
That sent Agent Ramachandran down a frightening
rabbit hole toward a small but incredibly

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:31.110
violent local cult.

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:36.459
The men claimed to be Thuggees - A historically
frightening group of roving robbers and murderers

00:09:36.459 --> 00:09:41.900
who terrorized parts of India throughout its
long history - and what’s more, this particular

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:47.380
sect of thugs seemed to worship the Daughter
Of Shadows as a kind of earth-bound demigod.

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:51.800
They believed that if they made one million
sacrifices to the violence-loving entity,

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:54.420
it would bring about the end of the world.

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:59.379
However, they also believed that only sacrifices
committed via strangulation would count towards

00:09:59.379 --> 00:10:01.650
their million-soul total.

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:05.949
The Foundation amassed a small invasion force
to infiltrate and take down their mountainside

00:10:05.949 --> 00:10:07.610
fortress from within.

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:12.140
Naturally, they were met with considerable
violent resistance - which sadly caused the

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:17.260
death of Agent Ramachandran, the very reason
we were able to locate the Daughter Of Shadows

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:20.879
in the first place - but in the end, the Foundation
prevailed.

00:10:20.879 --> 00:10:26.839
The Thuggees were either slaughtered or repelled,
and the Foundation operatives discovered SCP-029

00:10:26.839 --> 00:10:31.930
within the temple, along with a huge number
of corpses, believed to be the cult’s prior

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:33.160
victims.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:37.579
Given how dark it was inside the temple, the
Daughter of Shadows was at a formidable level

00:10:37.579 --> 00:10:38.620
of power.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:42.540
She killed and brainwashed several of the
agents who attempted to contain her, but was

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:47.160
eventually subdued and transported back to
the nearest secure containment site.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:52.500
One of the most infamous incidents that SCP-029
is associated with happened around seven years

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.069
after her capture.

00:10:54.069 --> 00:10:58.509
The level of dark pigmentation on her skin
was beginning to increase, prompting concern

00:10:58.509 --> 00:11:00.089
among researchers.

00:11:00.089 --> 00:11:03.690
When they asked her what was happening, she
simply said that her followers were on the

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:09.870
move again, prompting concern that 029’s
Thuggee cult was due for another resurgence.

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:14.670
Knowing how dangerous this cult could be,
the SCP Foundation decided that drastic action

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:17.470
would be needed to deal with them this time.

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:21.639
When they eventually located members of the
cult, they began tracking them and gathering

00:11:21.639 --> 00:11:22.730
intelligence.

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:27.019
They discovered that a mass gathering of the
entire cult was imminent, on a day that they

00:11:27.019 --> 00:11:28.800
believed to be holy.

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:31.430
The Foundation waited until then to strike.

00:11:31.430 --> 00:11:36.170
When the cult was gathered in worship, the
Foundation conducted an aerial strike, killing

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.390
them all in an instant.

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:42.519
The second this happened, the Daughter Of
Shadows sat bolt upright and screamed for

00:11:42.519 --> 00:11:46.920
several hours, mourning the death of her beloved
followers.

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:52.100
She learned a hard lesson that day: While
she and her methods were undeniably brutal,

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:57.779
when the situation called for it, the SCP
Foundation could be plenty brutal, as well.

00:11:57.779 --> 00:12:02.490
Since this incident, SCP-029 has increased
her efforts to escape.

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:06.350
Perhaps so she can get the jump on building
a brand new cult.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:12.779
Now go check out “SCP-1179 - Centralian
Fire Demon” and “SCP-2845 - Alien God

00:12:12.779 --> 00:12:17.860
Crash Lands on Earth - THE DEER” for more
fascinating and terrifying entities from the

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:18.439
SCP Foundation!

